8. Performance Targets
 * Functional GFR Equivalent: 10\text{ to }15\text{ mL/min} continuous filtration equivalent (100\% baseline metabolic clearance).
 * Urea Clearance Rate: 15\text{ to }25\text{ grams/day} (>0.4\text{ g/hr/100 cm}^2 active photoanode area).
 * Ultrafiltration Rate: 10\text{ to }30\text{ mL/hr} continuous fluid removal (240\text{ to }720\text{ mL/day}).
 * System Footprint: Enclosure dimensions measure 220\text{ mm} \times 160\text{ mm} \times 85\text{ mm}.
 * System Weight: Total dry weight \le 1.2\text{ kg}; operating wet weight (including 350 mL recirculating fluid) \le 1.55\text{ kg}.
9. Testing & Validation
 * Benchtop Validation:
   * Hydrostatic Leak Test: Manifold is pressurized with sterile saline at 300\text{ mmHg} for 30 minutes; must demonstrate zero pressure drop (\Delta P = 0\text{ mmHg}).
   * 72-Hour Recirculation Run: Continuous perfusion with synthetic uremic fluid (\text{BUN} = 80\text{ mg/dL}, Creatinine = 10\text{ mg/dL}) at 40\text{ mL/min} to confirm urea conversion efficiency and SNM flux stability (<5\% flux reduction).
 * Biocompatibility Testing (ISO 10993):
   * ISO 10993-4 (Hemocompatibility): Hemolysis index <1.0\%; zero platelet activation or thrombus formation over 72 hours; complement activation (C3a, SC5b-9) below baseline thresholds.
   * ISO 10993-5 (Cytotoxicity): MEM elution testing on pSBMA coatings and PEEK housing showing >90\% cell viability.
   * ISO 10993-10 (Irritation/Sensitization): Evaluation of UGIRAP gecko adhesive patch showing zero erythema or edema over continuous 72-hour dermal application.
 * Preclinical Pathway: 30-day continuous wear trials in companion animal models (feline/canine IRIS Stage 3/4 CKD) to evaluate in-vivo urea clearance, non-thrombogenic performance, and PEC gas venting safety.
 * FDA Regulatory Strategy: Class III medical device pathway (PMA). Preclinical animal safety and clearance data directly support FDA 21 CFR 312.300 (Expanded Access / Compassionate Use) petitions for terminally ill ESRD patients with failing vascular access.
