| PEC Sublimation Cell | Gas Bubble Ingress / Outgassing | PEC urea sublimation or air leaks | Potential vascular air embolism risk | Hydrophobic 0.2\ \mu\text{m} ePTFE vent + Torus-margo micro-valve line block |
| Proximal Tubule Bioreactor | Cell Monolayer Delamination | Fluid shear stress spike (>0.8\text{ dyne/cm}^2) | Loss of active ion/glucose reabsorption | Real-time shear auto-regulation + TEER monolayer integrity monitoring |
